OL,3,GNEWSADrought declared in Yorkshire
OL,4,Aafter dry weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FYorkshire Water said it was not
OL,7,Fplanning to introduce water
OL,8,Frestrictions for customers at this
OL,9,Fstage despite the drought declaration.
